      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"travel goblins\"? I'm just trying to figure out the logistics of my flight. Can we just focus on the actual flight paths? Between the Doha/Dubai hubs and looking for a different direct flight, what's the more reliable way to avoid further delays right now?",
